      "color": "5",
      "text": "# REDIVIDER — The Door — flow\n\n**Card** REDIVIDER\n**Day** Final Night\n\nChapter note: [[08 REDIVIDER — The Door]]\n\n---\n\nWorking surface, not canon. Fill from the chapter note, never the other way round. 🔧 marks nothing settled.\n\nStructure: [[The Day Loop]] · [[Saving]]\nLocks: [[Scope Ledger]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "workorder",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## Work order\n\nNone.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzles",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 268,
      "text": "## Puzzles\n\n- Through [[Room 696]] first, then the underwater heart.\n- **The usher.** Burning it yields **her breath** — [[Usher Burned]].\n- **The door ritual.** The key items are placed around the door. Pushing it open without placing them is an explicit choice, a second safety, so the Bad ending is always reachable and always informed.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "mazepocket",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 538,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## Maze / pocket\n\n🔧 The final maze.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "cutscenes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 216,
      "text": "## Cutscenes\n\n- Disposition receipts in three conversations: [[Eve]], the twins, and the last tape.\n- **The rose.** Anna gives him the fifth rose — the only one that reached her, preserved with her own blood in a glass jar. The chapter's revealing cutscene.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "npcdialogue",
      "type": "text",
